{"id":"n83871-2-6","stage":5,"title":"지휘 · 指挥","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83871-2-6-1","ko":"이것 봐. 내 지휘에 맞춰서 노래를 불러야지.","zh":"看这里。你们得跟着我的指挥来唱歌哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이것","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"지휘에","meaning":"指挥","explanation":"지휘：指挥；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지휘","audio":"/audio/460ff55ac7d717679cbc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83871","senseId":"2","lemma":"지휘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지휘에","audio":"/audio/e40c6368000ccc1ac087.mp3"}},{"text":"맞춰서","meaning":"迎合，配合","explanation":"맞추다：迎合，配合；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"맞추다","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74127","senseId":"8","lemma":"맞추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞춰서","audio":"/audio/9bbdde99e6d3e92a5cbb.mp3"}},{"text":"노래를","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래를","audio":"/audio/e4d8b71da5f5c71ee421.mp3"}},{"text":"불러야지.","meaning":"唱","explanation":"부르다：唱；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"4","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불러야지","audio":"/audio/8d6321a9a12676594057.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"460ff55ac7d71767","term":"지휘","zh":"指挥","audio":"/audio/460ff55ac7d717679cbc.mp3","entryId":"83871","definition":"在合唱、合奏时，站在前面引领众人，使大家的歌或演奏保持协调。","pronunciation":["지휘"]},{"id":"007d45bc6c182fe5","term":"맞추다","zh":"迎合，配合","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3","entryId":"74127","definition":"按照他人的意图或心情行动。","pronunciation":["맏추다"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"唱","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3","entryId":"57304","definition":"依照曲调歌唱。","pronunciation":["부르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/99eec94ada78fb2129bd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83871-2-6-2","ko":"죄송해요. 이제 지휘자님 손짓을 잘 볼게요.","zh":"对不起，我以后会好好注意指挥的手势的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"지휘자님","meaning":"指挥","explanation":"지휘자：指挥；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"지휘자","audio":"/audio/a03ada7fd1c290d5560f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83883","senseId":"2","lemma":"지휘자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지휘자님","audio":"/audio/efd7ec697b11b303d015.mp3"}},{"text":"손짓을","meaning":"手势","explanation":"손짓：手势；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"손짓","audio":"/audio/01610a73cd433175d532.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63902","senseId":"1","lemma":"손짓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손짓을","audio":"/audio/e36fd5cfe986e126367c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"仔细地，专注地","explanation":"잘：仔细地，专注地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"11","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼게요","audio":"/audio/2cd0ea99474da1b2d1a0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"a03ada7fd1c290d5","term":"지휘자","zh":"指挥","audio":"/audio/a03ada7fd1c290d5560f.mp3","entryId":"83883","definition":"在合唱、合奏等时，为了使众人的歌或演奏能够协调而站在前面引领的人。","pronunciation":["지휘자"]},{"id":"01610a73cd433175","term":"손짓","zh":"手势","audio":"/audio/01610a73cd433175d532.mp3","entryId":"63902","definition":"用手指着某物或表示自己的想法。","pronunciation":["손찓"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"仔细地，专注地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"集中注意力地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c5e0d6d67efe5801ae1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.458,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83871","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":166,"sequenceScore":3.2847,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我以后会好好注意指挥的手势的。","最近怎么对上课这么没兴趣啊？","看这里。你们得跟着我的指挥来唱歌哦。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，我以后会好好注意指挥的手势的。","看这里。你们得跟着我的指挥来唱歌哦。","最近怎么对上课这么没兴趣啊？"],"answer":0}]}
